{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>據知，一班靚仔靚女藝人的弟弟妹妹準備殺入娛樂圈，硬撼自己親生哥哥姐姐。當中有蘇雅琳（Ivy So）的弟弟Benny、P1X3L成員歐鎮灝（George）的妹妹Venus及葉振弘（Marco）弟弟。三位「星級細佬妹」青出於藍，男的長得帥氣，女長得標緻，顏值甚至比哥哥姐姐更高。</p><figure><img alt=\"蘇雅琳（Ivy So）的弟弟Benny。(ig@bennyso_)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260811/1163651983387922432479328.jpeg/KLEDo2AFJfK95i62cwGEmm0huAtnh0yUuxnCTbsZwk0\"/><figcaption>蘇雅琳（Ivy So）的弟弟Benny。(ig@bennyso_)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"歐鎮灝（George）的妹妹Venus。(ig@venusau.k)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260811/1163651980774739968350127.jpeg/Mm-Z4nYpp5pwOHrT1fchCuRrPyjWI5qWO8MNrjvDDa4\"/><figcaption>歐鎮灝（George）的妹妹Venus。(ig@venusau.k)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"葉振弘（Marco）弟弟。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260811/1163651978195111936710284.jpeg/oZOfXPnD8V3mLc-hYqblwWyLZaxlxU-bzhEJoc4RCaE\"/><figcaption>葉振弘（Marco）弟弟。</figcaption></figure><p>Ivy So化身弟弟Benny經理人</p><p>據悉這班「星級細佬妹」很快便會有公開活動，跟隨哥哥姐姐的腳步加入娛樂圈。而Ivy So更將會化身弟弟Benny的經理人，幫他接工作，未知到時會否見到「姐弟檔」合體現身活動。</p><figure><img alt=\"Ivy So化身弟弟Benny經理人。(ig@bennyso_)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260811/1163654456672391168478390.jpeg/bt5R2O0Fi7MsPbhuarl57FEoLmRZMi9Nzh1gcc4dYHE\"/><figcaption>Ivy So化身弟弟Benny經理人。(ig@bennyso_)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"據悉這班「星級細佬妹」很快便會有公開活動。(ig@bennyso_)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260811/1163654453941768192269014.jpeg/nA8Q_M96yPWDBhWz-8IBY9WcuZ7TYRfH74vYye-L2Mk\"/><figcaption>據悉這班「星級細佬妹」很快便會有公開活動。(ig@bennyso_)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"George的妹妹Venus好靚女。(ig@venusau.k)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260811/1163655048736149504514936.jpeg/MZdDl2Urtsc1NIiRcgezwsU0nJ4FHrlxrEzWSaxM1kk\"/><figcaption>George的妹妹Venus好靚女。(ig@venusau.k)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Venus好陽光feel。(ig@venusau.k)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260811/1163655046223630336834197.jpeg/K5BlLdhnRGMSB3PK8TEKAogC19RSsVU3r1XfTK9V30w\"/><figcaption>Venus好陽光feel。(ig@venusau.k)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-11T07:22:50.277936+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":455,"images":7,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}